## `export_refute_psimp`

``` hol4
Refute.export_refute_psimp : string -> unit
```

Exports the named theorem to the persistent Refute partial-specification
set, which the model finder uses for a constant that has no
`refute_simp` entry.

Every conjunct must be a conditional equation whose conclusion is
`c t1 ... tn = u`, `c t1 ... tn`, or `~(c t1 ... tn)`, with a constant
head `c`: the model finder looks the clause up by that head.  A clause
with no constant head cannot be found again and is dropped with a
warning.
